   "file": "default/31589.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Duda-Mara Totem Spirit: Although my eyes have dimmed, I am more aware than you can possibly imagine... The webs of the Duda-Mara span all dimensions of time and space! All events, even those that occur far away, are within my grasp.",
   "header": "Duda-Mara Totem Spirit",
